      "note": [
        "Note that target quantities, reported by industry and region, are modeled based on information at the employer level. For more information, please refer to the Quality Declaration documentation.",
        "Correction 2024-09-04: The statistics for the months 2020M01 to 2024M03 have been adjusted. Following the update, there are up to 142 000 fewer employments that were started, resumed, terminated or re-terminated in total.  \r\nWhen categorizing by size class, units with fewer than one employee are not included, resulting in the total number of employments being slightly lower than for the entire business sector."
